{{define "preheader"}}The report of an inspection of your home is ready.{{end}}
{{define "heading"}}Inspection report ready{{end}}
{{define "button"}}Open your tenancy{{end}}
{{define "why"}}You are receiving this because you rent this property on RightProperty365.{{end}}
{{define "body"}}
<p class="ink" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:Inter,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#131722;">{{if .Name}}Hello {{.Name}},{{else}}Hello,{{end}}</p>
<p class="ink" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:Inter,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#131722;">An inspection of your home was completed. You can read the report and download it as a PDF.</p>
<table role="presentation" class="facts" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:0 0 20px;background-color:#f8f9fc;border:1px solid #e6e9f0;border-radius:10px;"><tr><td style="padding:14px 16px;"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td class="fact-label" valign="top" width="38%" style="padding:4px 12px 4px 0;font-family:Inter,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:21px;color:#4f586a;">Reference</td><td class="ink" valign="top" style="padding:4px 0;font-family:Inter,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:21px;font-weight:600;color:#131722;">{{.Reference}}</td></tr><tr><td class="fact-label" valign="top" width="38%" style="padding:4px 12px 4px 0;font-family:Inter,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:21px;color:#4f586a;">Inspection</td><td class="ink" valign="top" style="padding:4px 0;font-family:Inter,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:21px;font-weight:600;color:#131722;">{{.RequestType}}</td></tr></table></td></tr></table>
<p class="ink" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:Inter,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#131722;">The findings, notes and photos are on RightProperty365. They are not included in this email.</p>
{{end}}
